From 5f1e3bdabab007bba62c98a926759cee5d7e0028 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 09:33:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Damoov telematics data model (Phase 1 of approved
 blueprint)

Creates driver_telematics_accounts, telematics_trips, telematics_events,
and telematics_live_status tables plus cars.damoov_vehicle_token, with
RLS matching the approved Option A architecture: existing homegrown
telemetry tables (vehicle_trips, driving_events, driver_live_status)
stay untouched as read-only history; owner live-location access is
gated structurally on an active, unmatched rental so it revokes itself
the moment a rental ends, with no application code needing to remember
to do so. Zero relationship to vehicle_inspections or any AI Inspection
table -- confirmed by walking the schema before writing this migration.

Migration was already applied directly to the Supabase project via the
Supabase MCP tools; this commit is the regenerated TypeScript types so
the client code stays in sync.
